<h1>About Pokedex Explorer</h1>

<p>
  Pokedex Explorer is a Ruby on Rails web application using data collected from another data source
</p>

<h2>Features</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Browse featured Pokemon</li>
  <li>Search Pokemon</li>
  <li>Browse by type</li>
  <li>Browse by Region</li>
  <li>View Pokemon details</li>
  <li>View random Pokemon</li>
</ul>

<h2>Database</h2>

<p>
  This application uses SQLite and Active Record
</p>
<h2>Data Source</h2>
<p>
  Pokemon information was imported from the public
  PokeAPI using a custom Rails seed file
</p>